    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keane Thompson is delighted to present No. 62 Whitehall Road West, Dublin 12 to the market. Situated within the ever-popular Whitehall Square development, this superb one-bedroom first-floor apartment offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation in a highly convenient residential setting. Presented in good condition throughout, No. 62 is an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors, or those looking to downsize without compromising on location or convenience.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 40 sq.m. (430 sq.ft.), the accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, a well-appointed bathroom, and a bright open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, creating a comfortable and functional living space perfect for modern lifestyles. Large windows flood the apartment with natural light, while the practical layout maximises every square metre.\r\nThe development is well maintained and benefits from attractive communal areas together with ample residents' parking, providing a peaceful environment just minutes from a host of local amenities.\r\n\r\nWhitehall Square enjoys an enviable location between Perrystown and Walkinstown. Residents benefit from an excellent selection of supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, schools, parks and leisure facilities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, offering regular bus routes to Dublin City Centre, while the M50 motorway is only a short drive away, providing convenient access to all major routes.\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained apartment in a mature and highly sought-after development, where convenience and comfort combine to create an exceptional place to call home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\n•\tSpacious one-bedroom first-floor apartment\r\n•\tApprox. 40 sq.m. / 430 sq.ft.\r\n•\tPresented in good condition throughout\r\n•\tBright open-plan living and dining accommodation\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows\r\n•\tElectric heating\r\n•\tWell-maintained communal grounds\r\n•\tAmple residents' parking\r\n•\tExcellent transport links\r\n•\tWalking distance to Ashleaf Shopping Centre and a wealth of local amenities\r\n•\tIdeal for first-time buyers, investors and downsizers alike"
      },
